{"title":"All Vacuum Cleaner","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc10","title":"Buture VC10 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 400W 38KPA","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuTure VC10 400W\/38KPA Powerful Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Touch Screen, 55 Min. Autonomy and Removable Battery, LED Light, 4 in 1 Floor\/Carpet\/Dog Hair Vacuum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【 400W\/38Kpa Powerful Vacuum Ceaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eVC10 Cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with the latest 400W brushless motor with 100,000rpm speed and offers 3 suction modes: MIN-17Kpa, MID-25Kpa and MAX-38Kpa for all types of waste. The MAX 38Kpa suction can easily clean up large particles such as dog food.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Touchscreen \u0026amp; Triple Protection】\u003c\/strong\u003eSweeper vacuum cleaners can set the suction power and check the remaining power through the touchscreen. The blockage detection function and three protection programs protect the motor and battery when the vacuum cleaner is blocked or misused, prolonging its life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【55 Mins Autonomy \u0026amp; Replaceable Battery】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless upright vacuum cleaner uses a 6*2500mAh battery and can work for 20-55 Mins depending on the used vacuum mode. The battery is removable and you can buy additional batteries for longer use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Optimal Filtration】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless vacuum cleaner adopts H13 Medical grade HEPA, which can filter 99.9% of particles as small as 0.3μm and 95% of bacteria and viruses as small as 0.1μm, preventing of allergies in children and pets. The filters are washable and the package contains 3pcs HEPA.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-zone-id=\"0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Cordless 4-in-1 Stick Vacuum Cleaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eThe floor brush of the stick vacuum cleaner can swivel 180° left and right and 90° up and down, and the LED light on the head helps you clean the dark corners. Equipped with 4 types of brushes and a telescopic tube to clean carpets, hard floors, furniture surfaces, crevices, and high places.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492634910975,"sku":"VC10","price":139.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/products\/VC10.jpg?v=1652079168"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr400","title":"Buture JR400 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 400W 38KPA","description":"\u003ch3\u003eButure JR400 Portable Carpet Cleaner\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile cordless vacuums are not suitable for long-pile carpets, they are ideal for most other low-pile carpets. Low-pile carpets often accumulate dust and debris that can be challenging to clean with traditional vacuums. A portable carpet cleaner like the Buture JR400 offers the perfect blend of power and convenience to tackle these challenges effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUnmatched Power and Convenience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR400 is designed to provide impressive cleaning power in a portable format. With adjustable suction power ranging from 18 kPa to 38 kPa and a 400W motor, this portable carpet cleaner tackles even the toughest carpet stains with ease. The touchscreen interface allows you to adjust the power settings with a simple slide of your finger, ensuring you have the right amount of power for every cleaning task.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasy Unboxing and Assembly\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you receive your Buture JR400, you’ll appreciate the detailed instructions provided right on the box. Inside, you’ll find a multilingual manual, making assembly straightforward and hassle-free. The components include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ergonomically designed for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrush Attachments\u003c\/strong\u003e: Versatile tools for different cleaning needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharger and Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ensures your portable carpet cleaner is always ready to go.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower Plug and Cleaner Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e: Essential for maintaining your vacuum.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eQuick and Simple Setup\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAssembling the Buture JR400 is a breeze. Just follow these steps:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAttach the handle to the main body.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect the brush attachment of your choice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsert the battery and power plug.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn just a few clicks, your portable carpet cleaner is ready to tackle any mess.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Cleaning Capabilities\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR400 isn’t just powerful; it’s incredibly versatile. Whether you need to clean tight corners, under furniture, or between couch cushions, this portable carpet cleaner has you covered. The brush attachments are perfect for various surfaces, and the extension bar helps you reach high and low spots effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasy Maintenance and Storage\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaintaining the Buture JR400 is simple. The vacuum comes with three HEPA filters—one pre-installed and two spares. When it’s time to clean the dust container, just pop it open and empty it. If the filter gets too dirty, swapping it out is a breeze. After use, you can charge the vacuum and hang it on the wall using the included hook, keeping your space clutter-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR400 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr400-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr400-table th, .jr400-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr400-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr400-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 99.9676%; height: 235.2px;\" class=\"jr400-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e400W\/38kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eNo\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e40-55mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003ex3\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492549091583,"sku":"JR400","price":139.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/products\/buture-jr400-stick-vacuum-cleaner.jpg?v=1747903090"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr500","title":"Buture JR500 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR500 stands out by combining the benefits of a stick vacuum with the convenience of a handheld vacuum. Compared to traditional handheld vacuums, this model offers powerful suction and the flexibility to transition from a full-sized stick vacuum to a compact handheld unit. This versatility makes it suitable for a variety of cleaning tasks, from floors to furniture and even your car interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful and Efficient Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR500 offers plenty of power and impressive suction, making it perfect for picking up pet hair, dust, and debris. Its lightweight and compact design makes it incredibly easy to use, whether on hard surfaces or carpets. Despite its power, it operates quietly, which was a pleasant surprise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Power Settings\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis handheld vacuum cleaner features three power settings: low, medium, and high. The powerful 2200mAh battery with quick charge capability ensures you have enough power to clean multiple large rooms, such as the living room and bedroom, without any issues. The three LED lights conveniently show how much charge is left, so you’re never caught off guard.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConvenient Attachments and Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR500 comes with a variety of attachments, including a mounting bracket for wall storage. The telescopic pole can be shortened or extended to suit the height of the person using it, adding to its ergonomic design. Cleaning is a breeze with this vacuum, and it even comes with an extra filter for convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo standout features of the power brush are the large wheels, which allow it to glide effortlessly over any surface, and the LED lights, which help illuminate your cleaning path. These features make the Buture JR500 even more efficient and user-friendly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR500 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr500-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr500-table th, .jr500-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: center;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr500-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr500-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"jr500-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e450W\/33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eNo\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e50-55mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e5.82 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492574617855,"sku":"JR500","price":139.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-jr500-cordless-vacuum-cleaner.jpg?v=1747901908"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr600","title":"Buture JR600 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 400W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eCleaning stairs is a frequent necessity, often required weekly, as stairs accumulate dirt, dust, and pet hair. Carpeted stairs trap allergens, wooden stairs collect dirt in crevices, and tiled stairs show debris quickly. The Buture JR600 smart vacuum is the perfect solution, featuring a lightweight, compact design and powerful suction. Its 10 adjustable suction modes and smart dust sensor ensure thorough cleaning, making it ideal for stairs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features and Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR600 is designed to deliver a seamless and efficient cleaning experience, featuring several innovative aspects:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e10 Adjustable Suction Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e The vacuum includes a mechanical knob that allows you to switch between 10 different suction settings, ranging from 10,000 Pascals to 33,000 Pascals, providing the perfect power level for any cleaning task.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Dust Sensor:\u003c\/strong\u003e This advanced sensor automatically adjusts the suction power based on the detected dust level, optimizing cleaning performance and energy efficiency.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for Stairs:\u003c\/strong\u003e Weighing just 5.7 lbs and featuring a compact design, the JR600 is ideal for cleaning stairs. Its powerful suction ensures thorough cleaning where traditional vacuums often struggle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLarge LED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e The display shows battery life and other important indicators, helping you keep track of the vacuum’s performance effectively.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA and Sponge Filters:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with both HEPA and sponge filters, the JR600 captures even the smallest particles, including allergens and dust, ensuring a cleaner and healthier home environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Runtime and Quick Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e The JR600 features a 7-cell 3500mAh battery that offers up to 55 minutes of runtime in auto mode and charges fully in 4-5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Attachments:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes an electric floor brush with LED headlights, a telescopic tube, a crevice tool, a two-in-one brush, and a hair cleaning tool, providing comprehensive cleaning for various surfaces and hard-to-reach areas.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e The JR600 also includes a touch screen for easy control, an aroma tablet for a pleasant cleaning experience, and a self-standing design for convenient storage.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR600 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr600-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr600-table th, .jr600-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: center;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr600-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr600-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"jr600-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e400W\/33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e55min\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e5.7 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAroma Tablet\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492580581631,"sku":"JR600","price":145.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture-JR600-cordless-vacuum-cleaner.jpg?v=1747899130"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc50","title":"Buture VC50 Blue Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eWithout the limitations of a power cord, cordless stick vacuums have revolutionized home cleaning by offering powerful performance. The Buture VC50 cordless vacuum cleaner boasts impressive suction and long-lasting battery life, making it a top choice for convenient and efficient cleaning. With its extendable stick and detachable design that converts into a handheld vacuum, you can effortlessly navigate around furniture, reach high and low spots, and clean your car interiors without any hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAutomatically Adjust Suction\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you're seeking a high-performance cordless stick vacuum with smart features and without a steep price tag, the VC50 Blue is a top contender. It offers three suction modes: 13Kpa, 23Kpa, and 33Kpa, allowing you to customize the power for various cleaning tasks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Auto Mode, the vacuum cleaner intuitively adapts to different floor types, optimizing suction power and runtime between carpets and hard floors. This smart adjustment ensures efficient cleaning without draining the battery unnecessarily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn our use, the VC50 Blue excelled on both hard floors and carpets, effectively removing dirt from edges and corners. The flexible stick design makes it easy to clean under furniture, and the LED headlights help illuminate dark areas, ensuring thorough cleaning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConvenient Wall-Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlways ready for your next clean! The BuTure VC50 cordless stick vacuum, with its sleek design, fits seamlessly into modern interiors. Unlike ordinary wall mount stands, it is equipped with a wall-mounted docking station that allows you to charge your vacuum directly while you store it. This means your vacuum is always charged and ready for use, saving you from the hassle of waiting for it to recharge before your next cleaning session.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe battery is also removable, providing flexibility to meet various charging needs. This thoughtful feature ensures you can charge the battery separately, making it convenient if you have limited wall outlets or need to charge multiple batteries at once. However, it's worth noting that while the docking station and removable battery are great for convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eIntelligent Features and Versatile Functionality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLED Touch Screen Features\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn LED Touch Screen on the top of the stick allows you to switch Auto \u0026amp; Manual modes seamlessly while vacuuming. This feature keeps you informed about battery life and maintenance needs, ensuring an optimized cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eTransforming to a Handheld Vacuum\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe stick of the VC50 can be easily removed and transformed into a handheld vacuum. Combined with the telescopic tube, it offers versatile floor-to-ceiling cleaning capabilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEfficient Air Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to the advanced multi-layer filtration of this stick vacuum, VC50 captures pet dander and fine dust, expelling cleaner air. This makes it ideal for households with pets or allergies, maintaining a healthier indoor environment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhole-Home Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLong Battery Life and Large Canister\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy up to 50 minutes of battery life in MIN suction mode, ensuring thorough whole-house cleaning. The 1.2L large canister on the top of the stick minimizes the need for frequent emptying. It is easy to empty the dust after you flick the switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMultiple Cleaning Tools\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50 Blue comes equipped with a crevice tool and a 2-in-1 brush, providing versatile solutions for various cleaning tasks. These attachments make it easy to clean tight spaces, upholstery, and a range of surfaces throughout your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently available at a competitive price, the VC50 Blue offers outstanding value, combining advanced features typically found in higher-end models with affordability. It's an excellent choice for those looking for a reliable and smart cordless stick vacuum.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1-year warranty, you can get a 3-year warranty after your registration on Buture Official Store.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat in the box:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Pack x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrevice Tool x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2-in-1 Brush x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Dock with Hardware Pack x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSponge Filters x2 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHEPA Filters x2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC50 Blue Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc50-details-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table th, .vc50-details-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc50-details-table\" style=\"width: 99.9282%; height: 235.096px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eAuto-adjust Suction\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e13Kpa, 23Kpa, 33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eUp to 50 minutes in MIN suction mode\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eDustbin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e1.2L\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e2.64kg\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eNoise Level\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e68 dB\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 39.1827px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eVersatile Attachments\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eTelescopic tube, crevice tool, 2-in-1 brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eCharging Dock\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWall-mounted with hardware pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eFilters Included\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eSponge filters x2, Inlet HEPA filters x2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWarranty\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eUp to 3 years\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45499200340223,"sku":"VC50B","price":145.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC50_Blue-Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745900282"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc50-red","title":"Buture VC50 Red Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eHave you ever wondered just how much dirt you're missing if you only use a regular broom instead of a powerful vacuum cleaner? With a vacuum cleaner, you can clean both visible dirt and the tiny particles you can’t see. A portable vacuum cleaner, like the Buture VC50 Red, offers the flexibility and ease to move around your home without lugging around a heavy machine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful and Efficient Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50 Portable Vacuum Cleaner stands out as a top choice for portable vacuum cleaners. Its powerful 450W motor, delivering 33Kpa suction power, handles dirt, dust, and debris effortlessly across carpets, hardwood floors, and upholstery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdaptive Cleaning Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith automatic adjustment, the VC50 seamlessly transitions between different surfaces, optimizing suction power for a thorough clean. The 55-minute runtime ensures you can clean large areas without interruption, and its lightweight 5.82 lbs design makes it easy to maneuver, whether you're tackling stairs, high shelves, or tight spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEfficient and Convenient Usage\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50’s 0.3-gallon dust bin means fewer trips to empty, and a quick 4-5 hour recharge time ensures it’s always ready for your next cleaning session. The touch screen interface is intuitive, allowing easy mode switching and status monitoring. Included attachments like the crevice tool for tight spaces, a two-in-one brush for versatile cleaning, and a hair cleaning tool for pet hair make it adaptable for any cleaning task.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Power and Enhanced Air Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50’s reliable battery pack provides consistent power, and dual HEPA and sponge filters capture fine dust and allergens, promoting cleaner air in your home. Although it doesn't stand on its own, the compact design makes it easy to store. Plus, it’s compatible with aroma tablets, adding a pleasant fragrance to your cleaning routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC50 Red Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc50-table\" style=\"width: 99.9288%; height: 274.491px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e450W\/33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eYes\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e55mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e5.82 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e0.3 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e4-5 Hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45499212562687,"sku":"VC50R","price":145.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC50_Red-Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745917317"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr700-red","title":"【Flash Sale】Buture JR700 Red Cordless Vacuum | 500W 45KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt Buture, we're all about making cleaning easier and more efficient for you. Our wireless vacuums have been a hit, and we've been listening to user’s feedback to make them even better. Meet the JR700 Red, the latest and one of the finest cordless vacuums in our JR wireless vacuum series This model packs a powerful 500-watt motor, perfect for tackling pet hair and tough messes. Plus, it features an upgraded color touchscreen, up to 55 minutes of runtime, and a new tangle-free roller.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/cordless-vacuum-for-hard-wood-floor_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUnboxing the Buture JR700 Red\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 comes in a sleek, silver box, reflecting its modern design and high-quality construction. Inside the box, you will find:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMain body with dust cup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFloor brush\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTelescopic tube\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrevice tool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmall cleaning brush\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery charger\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWall-mounted stand\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo additional HEPA filters(Total of three)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign and Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 stands out with its striking red color, a first for Buture's wireless cordless vacuum lineup. Its design is complemented by rating marks on the main body, telescopic tube, and floor brush, enhancing its sleek appearance. The football outlook design on the top serves as an air outlet, adding a modern touch to its functional design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/jr700-red-outlook-design_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUpgraded Touchscreen\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new color touchscreen on the JR700 provides real-time battery level monitoring, accurate to one percent increments. Users can easily adjust the suction power using the plus and minus buttons. The JR700 offers three suction modes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow: 18 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMedium: 30 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum: 45 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe screen also includes indicators for brush roller tangling and dust cup blockage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/JR700-red-wireless-vacuum-test-on-carpet_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEnhanced Filtration System\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 features a multi-stage filtration system, including three HEPA filters that are washable and recommended to be replaced every three months. The dust cup has a generous capacity of 1.5 liters and includes a metal filter for additional filtration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAccessories and Practical Use\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe floor brush has been upgraded with hardened bristles integrated into a single tangle-free roller, making it effective on both carpets and hard floors. The V-shaped roller design ensures no hair tangling, ideal for pet owners.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe crevice tool and round brush attachments make cleaning hard-to-reach places easy. The telescopic tube adjusts from 440 to 680 millimeters, providing flexibility in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNoise Levels\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 operates quietly, below 68dB. This design choice ensures a more peaceful cleaning experience, allowing you to use the cordless vacuum without disturbing others in your household.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLED Lights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFour LED lights on the floor brush illuminate dark areas, ensuring you don't miss any spots while cleaning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 7-cell removable battery has a capacity of 2200mAh, providing 55 minutes of runtime on low power mode and 20 minutes on high suction mode. This ensures you have ample time to clean your entire home on a single charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter testing the Buture JR700, it's clear that this model offers several upgrades over its predecessor, the JR600. With its powerful motor, enhanced touchscreen, and innovative design, the JR700 is a top choice for anyone seeking a reliable and efficient cordless vacuum cleaner. While it lacks the built-in dust sensor of the JR600, the JR700 more than makes up for it with its improved features and performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR700 Red Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr700-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th, .jr700-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr700-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 100%; height: 216.532px;\" height=\"384\" class=\"jr700-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 20.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 20.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 20.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cimg\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e500W\/45Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eUp to 55 minutes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e5.7 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003ex3\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492625211647,"sku":"JR700R","price":79.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_JR700_Red_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745921504"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc70","title":"Buture VC70 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 38KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Buture VC70 combines powerful suction with smart technology to make home cleaning easier than ever. This lightweight cordless vacuum features a 450W motor that effortlessly lifts dirt, dust, and pet hair from any surface. With smart suction adjustment, it automatically adapts to different floor types for optimal cleaning. Enjoy up to 55 minutes of runtime on a single charge, powered by a long-lasting battery. The advanced HEPA filtration system captures 99.9% of allergens, ensuring your home’s air is as clean as your floors. Plus, the anti-tangle brush head makes handling pet hair simple, leaving your home spotless without the hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Buture VC70?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Up to 55 Minutes of Super Long Runtime: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClean your entire home in one session with dual removable batteries offering up to 55 minutes of uninterrupted power in Eco mode. Say goodbye to frequent recharging and enjoy a more efficient, time-saving cleaning routine.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. 38kPa \u0026amp; 450W of Powerful Suction: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a robust 450W motor, the VC70 delivers an impressive 38kPa of suction power. This ensures that fine dust, dirt, and pet hair are effortlessly removed from any surface, whether it’s hardwood floors, carpets, or tiles. The powerful suction makes it ideal for homes with pets, tackling even the most stubborn debris in a single pass.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Intelligent Auto-Adjusting Suction: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC70 features a cutting-edge intelligent automatic gear adjustment system. It can detect changes in floor resistance and automatically adjust the suction power, ensuring optimal performance on different surfaces. This feature not only enhances the cleaning efficiency but also helps to conserve battery life during intensive cleaning tasks.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4. Enhanced LED Touchscreen Control: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC70 comes with a significantly larger LED touchscreen, making it easier to switch between modes and monitor the vacuum's status. The interface is twice the size of previous models, providing a more user-friendly experience and giving you total control over your cleaning process with just a touch.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5. Seven-Stage Advanced Filtration System:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eThis vacuum cleaner is designed with an advanced seven-stage filtration system, an upgrade from earlier models. It captures 99.9% of dust, allergens, and particles as small as 0.3 microns, ensuring that the air in your home remains clean and safe for your family.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e6. Anti-Tangle “S” Shaped Brush with LED Light:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eThe wide brush on this cordless vacuum comes equipped with an LED floor brush light, making it easy to see and pick up various particles. The \"S\"-shaped combination of soft and hard bristles efficiently collects hair and debris while minimizing tangles. Additionally, the side vents on the brush head allow you to clean right up against walls and easily capture debris from corners, ensuring nothing gets left behind.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e7. Versatile Cleaning Attachments: \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make your cleaning routine even more efficient, the VC70 comes with a variety of attachments, including an anti-tangle brush, a crevice tool, and a 2-in-1 brush head. These accessories make the vacuum versatile enough to handle different cleaning tasks, from tight spaces to upholstery, all with ease.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e8. Worry-Free Service: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour purchase comes with a up to 3-year warranty, and 24\/7 customer support. We’re committed to providing you with a high-quality experience. If you encounter any issues, please don’t hesitate to reach out—we’re here to help!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePerfect for Pet Owners and Allergy Sufferers\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered with pets and allergy sufferers in mind, the Buture VC70 ensures a deep clean every time. With its powerful suction and advanced filtration, you can maintain a cleaner, healthier home effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC70 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc70-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc70-table th, .vc70-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc70-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc70-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc70-table\" style=\"width: 99.9676%; height: 274.4px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeature\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecification\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e450W\/38kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e55mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492883161343,"sku":"VC70","price":159.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC70_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745834623"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc80","title":"Buture VC80 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 40KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eSearching for an intelligent cordless vacuum? Look no further than the BuTure VC80. This top-of-the-line cordless vacuum boasts a powerful 450W motor and 40kPa suction, ensuring deep cleaning across all surfaces. With its automatic suction adjustment, advanced six-layer filtration system, and smart touch screen, VC80 cordless vacuum brings a new level of convenience and efficiency to your cleaning routine. Its self-standing design and comprehensive accessory kit add to the ease and versatility. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Makes it Your Smart Decision:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAuto-adjust Suction Power\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features intelligent technology that automatically adjusts suction power based on the type of surface. When you move from a carpeted living room to a hardwood kitchen, this cordless vacuum will detect the change of floor type and adjust the suction power accordingly. This smart function ensures optimal cleaning performance without the need for manual adjustments, making your cleaning routine seamless and efficient, while optimizing battery usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Cleaning Routine:\u003c\/strong\u003e Automatically adjusts to the optimal suction power, eliminating the need for manual adjustments and making cleaning more convenient.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Battery Usage: \u003c\/strong\u003eBy switching to the appropriate mode, the vacuum conserves energy, ensuring longer battery life and more efficient cleaning sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Cleaning Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Adapts to different surfaces to provide the best cleaning results, ensuring every part of your home is spotless.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eThree Modes:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003col class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMAX Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40kPa suction power for deep cleaning. Ideal for heavily soiled carpets and rugs, this mode activates when the vacuum detects thick carpet fibers, providing a powerful clean for stubborn dirt and pet hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMID Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 28kPa suction power for everyday cleaning tasks. Perfect for regular maintenance on a variety of surfaces, the vacuum adjusts to this mode for moderate dirt and debris, balancing power and efficiency.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eECO Mode: \u003c\/strong\u003e15kPa suction power for extended battery life. Suitable for light cleaning tasks, this mode activates on hard floors, conserving energy and extending cleaning time, making it ideal for large areas or prolonged use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSelf-Standing Feature\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum is designed with a self-standing feature, offering unparalleled convenience and ease of use. This allows you to pause your cleaning at any time without needing to lean the vacuum against a wall or find a surface to prop it up. Simply let go, and the vacuum stands upright on its own.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHands-Free Convenience: Whether you need to answer the door, take a phone call, or move furniture, the self-standing feature ensures your vacuum is always ready to go when you return.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Storage: The Buture VC80 cordless vacuum offers versatile storage options, allowing you to either stand it on the floor or mount it on the wall.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Stability: Reduces the risk of the vacuum tipping over, protecting both the appliance and your home from potential damage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Accessibility: Perfect for quick clean-ups and spot cleaning, as you can easily grab and use the vacuum without hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSmart Touch Screen Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features a sleek and intuitive smart touch screen, adding modern technology to your cleaning routine. This user-friendly interface allows you to easily switch between Eco, Mid, and Max modes with a simple touch, ensuring the right power level for any task. Real-time monitoring lets you keep an eye on battery life, dust cup fullness, and filter maintenance, preventing interruptions and maintaining optimal performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, the touch screen provides timely maintenance alerts, ensuring your vacuums work at peak efficiency. This advanced design enhances your user experience, making cleaning more effortless and enjoyable. The clear, responsive display transforms vacuuming into a seamless and modern experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSix-Layer Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum is equipped with an advanced six-layer filtration system, ensuring that your home remains clean and free from allergens.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Primary Filter: Captures large particles such as hair and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Secondary Filter: Provides an additional layer of filtration for medium-sized particles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA Filter: Traps fine dust and allergens, ensuring that only clean air is expelled.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSponge Filter: Adds an extra layer to capture smaller dust particles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDust Cup: Efficiently collects and holds dust and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotor Air Cooling Filter: Protects the motor by filtering the air, ensuring long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdvanced Design of VC80 Cordless Vacuum\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum stands out not only for its powerful performance and intelligent features but also for its advanced design elements that elevate your cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEasy Dust Cup Emptying\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe vacuum features a one-click emptying mechanism, allowing you to quickly and effortlessly dispose of collected dust and debris without making a mess. This hassle-free process ensures that you can maintain the vacuum's performance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eFilter Maintenance Alerts\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe smart touchscreen provides notifications for timely filter cleaning and replacement. These alerts ensure that your vacuum operates at peak efficiency, prolonging its lifespan and maintaining optimal suction power.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAnti-Tangle Roller Brush with LED Floor Lights\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features anti-tangle roller brush heads, designed to prevent hair and debris from clogging, ensuring smooth operation. Its specialized bristles effectively clean edges and corners, leaving no dirt behind. If necessary, the vacuum comes with a small cutting tool included in the accessory kit to help you easily remove any tangled hair, enhancing the anti-tangle feature and keeping your vacuum performing at its best. Additionally, the brush is equipped with LED floor lights that illuminate dark areas, ensuring you don’t miss any hidden dirt and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eComprehensive Accessory Kit\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncluded Attachments:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrevice tool, dusting brush, electric floor brush, mini cleaning brush.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA filters (2), sponge filters (2), telescopic tube, wall mount, and charger.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Cleaning Efficiency: Attachments designed for specific cleaning tasks and surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC80 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc80-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc80-table th, .vc80-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc80-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc80-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc80-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e450W\/40kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e50-60mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSelf-Standing\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492889256191,"sku":"VC80","price":159.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC80_Cordless_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745832018"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-bp10","title":"Buture BP10 Cordless Vacuum | 450W 38KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you’re seeking the perfect balance of power and gentleness, the Buture BP10 is a game-changer in hardwood floor vacuums. Tailored for homes with mainly hardwood floors and a few area rugs, this vacuum's edge cleaning design and dual bristle technology ensure every corner is spotless. Its intelligent automatic suction mode adapts effortlessly to different floor types, providing just the right amount of power to avoid damaging your hardwood floor. Whether you're maintaining immaculate hardwood floors or tackling low-pile rugs, the Buture BP10 stands out as a versatile and highly effective cleaning solution, making it one of the best cordless vacuums for hardwood floors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy BP10 Vacuum is Ideal for Hardwood Floors\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePreserving the pristine condition of hardwood floors demands a vacuum designed for the task. The Buture BP10 excels in this area, blending robust suction power with a gentle approach to floor care.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003ePowerful Suction\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThree Suction Modes: 18KPa, 30KPa, 38KPa\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e450W Motor\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eButure BP10 features a high-speed, high-torque motor that provides exceptional suction power. This ensures that all surface debris, from dust and pet hair to crumbs, dirt, and even cat litter on your bare floors, is effectively picked up, making it an ideal hardwood floor vacuum.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eGentle on Hardwood Floors\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Soft and Stiff Bristles\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BP10's cleaner head is equipped with both soft and stiff bristles, offering a meticulous clean without scratching delicate hardwood surfaces. This dual-bristle technology eliminates the need to switch heads when transitioning between hardwood floors and carpets, ensuring your floors remain spotless and undamaged. \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEdge Cleaning Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCrevice Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2-in-1 Brush Head\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED lights\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BP10 Vacuum is expertly crafted to capture dust and debris on bare floors, ensuring your hardwood floors remain pristine and free of dust that often accumulates along baseboards and in corners. With its Crevice Brush and extendable stick, it reaches under sofas, beds, and other large furniture, tackling those hard-to-reach areas effortlessly. The versatile 2-in-1 Brush Head with LED lights handles everything from sofas to curtains and beds, delivering a thorough and efficient cleaning throughout your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEffectiveness on Mixed Surfaces\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto-adjust suction power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BP10’s intelligent automatic suction adjustment ensures optimal performance across hardwood floors, low-pile rugs, and area rugs without manual intervention, making it a versatile choice for all your floor cleaning needs. On hardwood floors, it minimizes the risk of damage and prevents debris from scattering, while on rugs and carpets, it increases power to lift embedded dirt and pet hair effectively.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eOther Features for Your Whole House Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BP10 is an excellent vacuum, especially on hardwood floors. However, it's designed for comprehensive whole-house cleaning, making it versatile and effective on various surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUp to 55 minutes of runtime\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 2200mAh 7-cell battery, the BP10 offers up to 55 minutes of cleaning on its lowest suction setting, allowing you to keep your hardwood floors and an entire 200㎡ house clean without needing to recharge. You can also purchase extra batteries for longer cleaning sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAll-in-One Color Touch Screen\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasily switch modes (Eco, Standard, Boost, Auto) with the intuitive LED touch screen. Real-time monitoring of battery life, dust cup fullness, and filter maintenance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMulti-Filtration\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BP10 vacuum features an advanced filtration system with HPEA, sponge, micro multi cone, stainless steel, cyclone, and host sponge filters, ensuring powerful suction and clean air. This vacuum captures 99.99% of fine particles on your hardwood floor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUsability and Convenience\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLarge 1.5L Canister: \u003c\/strong\u003eClean your entire house without interruptions, making it an ideal hardwood floors vacuum for keeping them tidy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eManeuverable Design: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe head swivels 270°, and the extendable wand (44-68cm) easily reaches tight corners and high spots\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuiet Operation: \u003c\/strong\u003eAt 68dB, enjoy a peaceful cleaning experience while maintaining pristine hardwood floors.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWall Mount: \u003c\/strong\u003eKeep your hardwood floors vacuum-organized and accessible with the convenient wall mount.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure BP10 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .bp10-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .bp10-table th, .bp10-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .bp10-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .bp10-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"bp10-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e\n\u003cimg\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e450W\/38Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUp to 55 minutes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e7 Pounds\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492436304127,"sku":"BP10","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_BP10_Cordless_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745827233"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr700-blue","title":"Buture JR700 Blue Cordless Vacuum | 550W 45KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a new era of effortless cleaning with the Buture JR700 Blue Cordless Vacuum Cleaner. Engineered with a robust 550W brushless motor, this cordless marvel conquers pet hair, dust, and debris with ease. Featuring a sleek smart touch screen and an advanced multi-filtration system, it guarantees an immaculate clean every time. The game-changing wall-mounted charging dock not only saves space but also ensures your vacuum is always ready to go. With a powerful 55-minute battery life, it’s designed for large homes and demanding tasks. Revolutionize your cleaning routine with the Buture JR700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner – where power meets intelligence in perfect harmony.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful and Efficient Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eButure JR700 cordless vacuum cleaner's adjustable suction levels make it suitable for various cleaning scenarios, ensuring that every part of your home is spotless.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e550W Brushless Motor and Suction Power\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHigh-Performance Motor: The Buture JR700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner is equipped with a 550W brushless motor, engineered to deliver powerful and efficient cleaning performance. This motor ensures robust suction and reliable operation for a variety of cleaning tasks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eThree Adjustable Suction Levels:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e18KPA: \u003c\/strong\u003eLight cleaning (dusting, daily maintenance)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e30KPA:\u003c\/strong\u003e Medium cleaning (coffee beans, small debris)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e45KPA:\u003c\/strong\u003e Medium cleaning (coffee beans, small debris)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Blue is equipped with a 2200mAh 7-cell removable Li-on battery, engineered for extended performance. Here is different runtimes depending on the suction level:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLow Power (18KPA):\u003c\/strong\u003e 55 mins\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMedium Power (30KPA): \u003c\/strong\u003eBalanced runtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Power (45KPA): \u003c\/strong\u003e15 mins \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUser-Friendly Smart Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSmart Touch Screen\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Blue Cordless Vacuum Cleaner is equipped with an intuitive smart touch screen that enhances user experience by providing real-time information and easy control adjustments. Key features of the smart touchscreen include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Level: \u003c\/strong\u003eDisplays the remaining battery life, allowing you to monitor and manage your cleaning time effectively.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSuction Level: \u003c\/strong\u003eShows the current suction power setting (18KPA, 30KPA, 45KPA), enabling you to adjust the suction strength based on your cleaning needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrush Roller Status: \u003c\/strong\u003eIndicates the status of the brush roller, alerting you if there are any issues such as tangling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDust Sensor Alerts: \u003c\/strong\u003eNotify you if the dust sensor is blocked, ensuring optimal performance and efficient cleaning.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConvenience and Maneuverability\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e1. Wall-Mounted Charging Dock\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner features a sleek wall-mounted charging dock, designed to streamline your cleaning routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEffortless Storage\u003c\/strong\u003e: Mount the dock on any wall to keep your vacuum cleaner off the floor, freeing up space and reducing clutter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAutomatic Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simply place this cordless vacuum cleaner on the dock, and it automatically begins charging, ensuring it’s always ready for your next cleaning session.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOrganized and Tidy:\u003c\/strong\u003e This setup eliminates the need for separate charging cables, keeping your space neat and your vacuum always within reach.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. Anti-Tangle Floor Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Blue vacuum cleaner features a short-bristle design that resists tangling and operates at a noise level of only 68 dB. Additionally, it comes equipped with an anti-tangle tool to effortlessly handle hair and other tangles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e3. LED Lights\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe integrated LED lights illuminate dark corners and under furniture, making hidden dust and dirt visible and ensuring no spot is missed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e4. Flexible Movement\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe brush head swivels 180° left\/right and 90° up\/down, allowing you to easily maneuver around furniture and reach tight spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Cleaning Accessories\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eComprehensive Accessory Kit\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner comes with a versatile accessory kit designed to tackle various cleaning tasks throughout your home. Here's an overview of the included accessories and their benefits:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRound Brush:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideal for dusting and cleaning delicate surfaces such as curtains, upholstery, and blinds. The soft bristles gently remove dust and allergens without damaging the fabric.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTelescopic Tube: \u003c\/strong\u003eExtends to reach high areas like ceilings, shelves, and drapery rods. It allows for easy adjustment of length, making it convenient for users of different heights and for cleaning hard-to-reach places.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e2-in-1 Crevice Brush:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect for cleaning tight spaces and corners, such as between couch cushions, along baseboards, and in car interiors. Its narrow design ensures that no dirt or debris is left behind in those hard-to-access spots.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVacuum Hose: \u003c\/strong\u003eFlexible and bendable, this tube is great for reaching under furniture, around obstacles, and in narrow spaces. It provides the flexibility needed to clean areas that are otherwise difficult to access with a rigid tool.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Filtration System\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 Blue Cordless Vacuum Cleaner features an advanced multi-filtration system designed to capture and contain dust, allergens, and fine particles, ensuring a cleaner home environment. Each stage of the filtration process plays a crucial role in maintaining effective cleaning and improving air quality:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCyclonic Filtration: \u003c\/strong\u003eUtilizes centrifugal force to separate large particles from the airflow, preventing clogging and maintaining consistent suction power.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStainless Steel Filtration: \u003c\/strong\u003eA durable, washable filter that traps medium-sized particles, enhancing the vacuum's longevity and providing a robust layer of protection.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMulticore Filtration: \u003c\/strong\u003eEnsures fine dust particles are efficiently separated from the air, optimizing the vacuum's overall performance and preventing fine dust from re-entering the environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA Filtration: \u003c\/strong\u003eCaptures 99.97% of particles as small as 0.3 microns, including allergens and pollutants, significantly improving indoor air quality and making it essential for allergy sufferers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAir Outlet Filtration:\u003c\/strong\u003e This guarantees that the air expelled from the vacuum is clean and free from contaminants, contributing to a healthier living environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR700 Blue Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr700-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th, .jr700-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr700-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"jr700-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e550W\/45Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eNo\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUp to 55 minutes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e7 Pounds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex3\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492629405951,"sku":"JR700B","price":150.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_JR700_Blue_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745918968"},{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc60","title":"Buture VC60 Cordless Vacuum | 450W 38KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eIs there any better feeling than coming home to a spotless house after a long day? Probably not, but the frustration of lugging around a heavy vacuum can quickly dampen that joy. With the right lightweight vacuum cleaner, however, keeping your home clean becomes a breeze. Imagine effortlessly gliding from room to room, picking up every bit of dirt and debris with ease, without the strain on your arms or back. If you're in the market for the best lightweight vacuum that combines power and convenience, the Buture VC60 is the perfect choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture VC60 is the lightest cordless vacuum in Buture's lineup, weighing just 5.95 lbs. This lightweight design is perfect for effortlessly maneuvering around your home, whether you’re cleaning tight spaces, stairs, or high surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful Performance in a Lightweight Package\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith three power modes—Eco, Middle, and Max—the VC60 delivers strong cleaning performance across a variety of surfaces. The motorized brush effectively lifts dirt and hair from carpets and upholstery, while the crevice tool is perfect for reaching into hard-to-access areas. The vacuum transitions smoothly from rugs to hardwood floors, ensuring no dirt or debris is left behind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNo Smell? Freshen Your Home as You Clean \u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile powerful suction is a must for any lightweight vacuum, it often doesn't eliminate the lingering odors from dirt, dust, pet hair, and food debris. But there's good news for BuTure VC60 users. Our latest innovation, the scented card, tackles this issue head-on. Recent feedback from BuTure VC60 owners shows that 90% noticed a significant reduction in odors after using the scented card.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur scented card is free of alcohol and additives, perfect for homes with babies, pets, and sensitive individuals. Vacuum with the BuTure VC60 cordless vacuum cleaner and enjoy a refreshing fruity scent that enhances your well-being.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesigned for Ease of Use\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 is built with the user in mind, prioritizing simplicity and ease of use. Its innovative double-handle design provides superior control and reduces strain, making it easy to maneuver even during extended cleaning sessions. The power and setting buttons are conveniently located for easy access, and the extendable pole adapts to various heights at the push of a button, making it ideal for users of all sizes. Switching between attachments is effortless, allowing you to transition smoothly between different cleaning tasks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Attachments for Any Job\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 is equipped with a variety of attachments to handle a range of cleaning tasks. The extendable pole can be adjusted to the perfect height, allowing you to clean everything from low-lying areas to high ceilings without strain. The vacuum attachment, motorized brush, and crevice tool provide the flexibility to clean different surfaces and reach tight spaces easily. Each attachment locks securely into place, ensuring a stable and effective cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStorage and Charging Made Simple\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 comes with a wall mount for convenient storage. The battery and attachments can be securely hung on the wall mount, keeping everything organized and easily accessible. Its compact design means it can fit seamlessly into any storage space, making it a great choice for homes with limited space. Plus, the quick 4-5 hour recharge time means your vacuum is always ready for action.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc60-table {\n        width: 96.4943%;\n        height: 582px;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .vc60-table th, .vc60-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n    .vc60-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc60-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc60-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e450W\/38Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eNo\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUp to 55 minutes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDouble-Handle\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAroma Tablet\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492869234943,"sku":"VC60","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC60_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1769151288"},{"product_id":"jr700-blue-1-battery-6-hepa-filters-bundle","title":"Vacuum Bundle: Buture JR700 Blue Vacuum + 2 Batteries + 9 HEPA Filters","description":"\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eJR700 Blue Vacuum Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1 x JR700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner\u003c\/strong\u003e (Comes with \u003cstrong\u003e1 battery\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e3 pieces of \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 1 additional battery\u003c\/strong\u003e (Extend your cleaning sessions)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 6 additional HEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e (Maintain top performance with extra dust and allergen protection)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eJR700 Blue Vacuum Bundle Plus\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes everything from the standard bundle, plus:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChoice of: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 Floor Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e (Versatile for different surfaces), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Vacuum Hose \u003c\/strong\u003e(Perfect for reaching tight spaces), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Dust Cup \u003c\/strong\u003e(Easily removable and washable for longer cleaning sessions) \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet the ultimate flexibility with essential extras for uninterrupted and thorough cleaning.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"JR700 Blue+2 Batteries+9 HEPA Filters","offer_id":46056412840191,"sku":"JR700BKB-1","price":190.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"JR700 Blue+2 Batteries+9 HEPA Filters+1 Vacuum Hose","offer_id":46056412872959,"sku":"JR700BKB-2","price":192.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"JR700 Blue+2 Batteries+9 HEPA Filters+1 Dust Cup","offer_id":46215704150271,"sku":"JR700BKB-3","price":192.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"JR700 Blue+2 Batteries+9 HEPA Filters+1 Floor Brush","offer_id":46215707885823,"sku":"JR700BKB-4","price":199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/JR700_BLUE_Vacuum_Bundle.jpg?v=1730200408"},{"product_id":"buture-vac01-cordless-stick-vacuum","title":"Buture VAC01 Aromatherapy Cordless Vacuum | 600W 50KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Buture VAC01 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner - Your ultimate cleaning companion. This advanced cordless vacuum features a robust 600W motor with 50kPa suction power, ensuring exceptional performance across all surfaces. With its self-standing design, smart touch screen, and versatile cleaning modes, the VAC01 offers a superior cleaning experience for every home. Enjoy convenience with the integrated wall mount and a comprehensive accessory kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Buture VAC01 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIncredible and Uninterrupted Cleaning\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"numPr\":{\"id\":\"0\",\"level\":0},\"rPr\":{\"bold\":false,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"宋体\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"hint\":\"default\"},\"sz\":10.5,\"szUnit\":\"pt\"},\"uuid\":\"m8r57jqvete1g6jzrpy\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":false,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"宋体\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"hint\":\"default\"},\"sz\":10.5,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Powered with high-performance 550W motor to provide accelerated 45kPA suction, the Buture VAC01 Vacuum Cleaner effortlessly lifts surface debris and embedded dirt, outperforming 95% of vacuums on the market, making it ideal for both carpets and hard floors. Enjoy an uninterrupted cleaning routine with its 8-cell lithium battery when ridding your home of various hair, dirt, and other messes.\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4jKqmoRaA1eZlw19\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePowered with high-performance 600W motor to provide accelerated 50kPA suction, the Buture VAC01 Vacuum Cleaner effortlessly lifts surface debris and embedded dirt, outperforming 95% of vacuums on the market, making it ideal for both carpets and hard floors. Enjoy an uninterrupted cleaning routine with its 8-cell lithium battery when ridding your home of various hair, dirt, and other messes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional Suction Power:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tackles stubborn dirt and pet hair with ease, ensuring a thorough clean.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for all types of surfaces, from carpets to hardwood floors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficient Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Provides superior cleaning results, saving time and effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSelf-Standing Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 features a self-standing design, allowing you to pause and resume cleaning without needing to lean the vacuum against a wall. This design ensures easy storage and access, making it perfect for quick clean-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHands-Free Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Conveniently pauses and resumes cleaning without hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpace-Saving Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stand it upright anywhere in your home for easy access and storage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Stability:\u003c\/strong\u003e Reduces the risk of tipping over, ensuring safety and longevity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIntegrated Wall Charging Mount\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 comes with an integrated wall mount that functions as both a charging station and storage solution. Charge your vacuum quickly and keep accessories organized, or remove the battery for separate charging if preferred.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConvenient Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wall mount charges the vacuum and stores accessories, ready for the next use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexible Charging Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Remove the battery for separate charging if needed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOrganized Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep your cleaning tools neatly arranged and accessible.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSmart Touch Screen with 4 Cleaning Modes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe intuitive smart touch screen allows easy mode selection with a simple touch. Choose from ECO, STANDARD, BOOST, or AUTO modes to suit different cleaning tasks and floor types. AUTO mode adjusts suction power automatically for optimal performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eModes:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003col class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBOOST Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50kPa for deep cleaning carpets and removing pet hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSTANDARD Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30kPa for routine cleaning tasks on various surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eECO Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 18kPa for light cleaning and energy conservation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdvanced Multi-Layer Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 features a sophisticated multi-layer filtration system to ensure a clean and allergen-free environment. The system includes a stainless steel filter, HEPA filter, sponge filter, and more to capture particles of all sizes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Filter: Captures large debris and hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA Filter: Traps fine dust and allergens for cleaner air.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSponge Filter: Adds an extra layer of dust capture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotor Air Cooling Filter: Protects the motor for consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDust Cup: Holds and collects dust and debris efficiently.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VAC01 Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vac01-table\" style=\"width: 101.25%; height: 553px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e600W\/50kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eUp to 60 minutes (Boost mode: 30 mins)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSelf-Standing\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e6 Pounds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eDust Cup Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eTwo-in-One Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eHEPA Filters\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSponge Filters\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eWall Mount\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eAromatic Tablets\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46075371913471,"sku":"VAC01","price":169.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VAC01Cordless_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1732521673"},{"product_id":"buture-jr700-red-vacuum-2-batteries-9-hepa-filters-bundle","title":"Vacuum Bundle: Buture JR700 Red Vacuum + 2 Batteries + 9 HEPA Filters","description":"\u003ch5\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e🎁 \u003c\/strong\u003eJR700 Red Vacuum Bundle\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1 x JR700 Red Cordless Vacuum\u003c\/strong\u003e Cleaner (Comes with\u003cstrong\u003e 1 battery\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e3 pieces of \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 additional battery (Extend your cleaning sessions)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6 additional HEPA filters (Triple your protection against dust and allergens)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e🎁 \u003c\/strong\u003eJR700 Red Vacuum Bundle Plus\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes everything from the standard bundle, plus:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChoice of: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 Floor Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e (Versatile for different surfaces), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Vacuum H