","offer_id":46297667895551,"sku":"BP20","price":179.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_BP20_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1744257758"},{"product_id":"vacuum-bundle-buture-vac01-vacuum-2-batteries-8-hepa-filters","title":"Vacuum Bundle: Buture VAC01 Vacuum + 2 Batteries + 8 HEPA Filters","description":"\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eVAC01 Vacuum Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1 x VAC01 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner\u003c\/strong\u003e (Comes with \u003cstrong\u003e1 battery\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e2 pieces of \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 1 additional battery\u003c\/strong\u003e (Extend your cleaning sessions)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 6 additional HEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e (Maintain top performance with extra dust and allergen protection)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eVAC01 Vacuum Bundle Plus\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes everything from the standard bundle, plus:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChoice of: 1 Stainless Steel Filter\u003c\/strong\u003e (Durable and reusable for long-term use), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Floor Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e (Versatile for different surfaces), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Dust Cup \u003c\/strong\u003e(Easily removable and washable for longer cleaning sessions) \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"VAC01+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters","offer_id":46341504696575,"sku":"VAC01KB-1","price":229.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"VAC01+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Stainless Steel Filter","offer_id":46341504729343,"sku":"VAC01KB-2","price":254.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"VAC01+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Dust Cup","offer_id":46341504762111,"sku":"VAC01KB-3","price":254.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"VAC01+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Floor Brush","offer_id":46341504794879,"sku":"VAC01KB-4","price":259.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/VAC01_vacuum_cleaner_bundle.jpg?v=1755596645"},{"product_id":"buture-x9-vacuum-cleaner","title":"Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum | 600W 50KPA 60min Runtime","description":"\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"h2\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmh1e4c632pi5h\",\"jc\":\"left\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":21.333333333333332,\"after\":9,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":16,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"New Release! Master pet messes with the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner. 🐶🐶\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbstd18qhpx7md2dmlu\",\"jc\":\"left\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Its tangle-free brush roll and multi-surface capabilities simplify pet cleanup. Embrace effortless pet fur, dust, and debris cleanup with a cordless stick vacuum designed for pet-tailored home care.  \"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmhol0nevf6rj\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Powerful Pet Messes Cleanup\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmigjppxqpjg2f\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Advanced 600W motor delivers exceptional 50 kPa suction power, easily remove pet fur everywhere and clean pet food spills and muddy paw prints from kitchens and busy entrance ways. Effortlessly transition from carpeted surfaces to hard floors, all while enjoying powerful suction for the ultimate clean.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmi9tf04fsl3ld\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Simple Pet Hair Removal\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmiv5e5yi9umvk\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Conquer pet hair removal with Buture X9 Vacuum tangle-free brush roll, which minimizes hair wrap and clogging while you clean, and a crevice tool, which uses powerful suction to remove fur, hair, dust, and debris from tight spaces.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmiubnp64u6rc\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Multi-layer Filtration System and Allergen Trapping\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjffu0cx7i9dm\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner features a multi-layer filtration system that ensures a clean, allergen-free environment. With filters like HEPA, stainless steel, and sponge filters, it captures particles of all sizes for a more thorough cleaning process.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjywew6qvb2bk\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Effortless From Start to Storage\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjsou473063dq\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Experience versatile maintenance features, from seamless wall mount storage solutions to the easy empty dust cup. Enjoy hassle-free storage, cleaning, and waste disposal, ensuring your vacuum is always ready for the next use.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjzm7klmesxb\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 See Everything, Clean Everywhere\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmk5mi0f4l9zbk\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Swivel Steering allows X9 Cordless Stick Vacuum to maneuver wherever you need it to go, no matter what obstacles are in the way. The LED headlight illuminates hidden dirt, pet hair, and debris on hard floors and carpets for a thorough clean in every nook and cranny.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmk736hzguaq0e\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Multi-surface and Multi-level Cleaning\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmkpnohwk4qit\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Instantly transition from cleaning hard floors to high ceilings, effortlessly captures dust and debris on low-pile carpets, stairs, bare floors, and sealed hard floors,making the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner a truly all-in-one cleaning solution.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmkf494xs6qgad\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 User-friendly Design, Enjoy Secure Storage\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbml5j5wx475a3v\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Self-standing Feature: Simply pause your cleaning session and let the vacuum stand upright, without the need to lean it against a wall\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbml3343359b0u8\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Innovative Wall Mount: Securely rest your vacuum against the wall for stable, convenient storage, maximizing space and efficiency\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmly877oyz31f\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🏆Why Choose the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner 600W 50KPA Perfect for Pet Owners?\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbml8k066u0ziku\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Powerful Suction:\"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\" Delivers superior cleaning results on all surfaces\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmlcsc5060eth9\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Convenient Design:\"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\" Self-standing feature and wall mount charging for easy storage and access\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmo5me7ap5y2x2\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Smart Technology:\"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\" LED touch screen for easy mode selection and real-time adjustments\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmozd80t786o7\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Allergen-free Cleaning:\"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\" Advanced filtration system for a healthier home environment\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmogg82swhizt5\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Long Runtime: \"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Extended battery life for uninterrupted cleaning\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmo56pn21embpn\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Versatile Attachments: \"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Cleans every corner of your home with ease\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmphr4rh266qin\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"✔️Easy to Maintain: \"],[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Hands-free dustbin emptying and easy filter maintenance\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmpybmv3jx0i3\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Upgrade your cleaning experience with the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner and enjoy a cleaner, healthier, and more efficient home.🚀 \"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4jKqmoRaA1eZlw19\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eNew Release! Master pet messes with the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eIts tangle-free brush roll and multi-surface capabilities simplify pet cleanup. Embrace effortless pet fur, dust, and debris cleanup with a cordless stick vacuum designed for pet-tailored home care. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePowerful Pet Messes Cleanup\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAdvanced 600W motor delivers exceptional 50 kPa suction power, easily remove pet fur everywhere, and clean pet food spills and muddy paw prints from kitchens and busy entrance ways. Effortlessly transition from carpeted surfaces to hard floors, all while enjoying powerful suction for the ultimate clean.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSimple Pet Hair Removal\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eConquer pet hair removal with the Buture X9 Vacuum tangle-free brush roll, which minimizes hair wrap and clogging while you clean, and a crevice tool, which uses powerful suction to remove fur, hair, dust, and debris from tight spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eMulti-layer Filtration System and Allergen Trapping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner features a multi-layer filtration system that ensures a clean, allergen-free environment. With filters like HEPA, stainless steel, and sponge filters, it captures particles of all sizes for a more thorough cleaning process.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eEffortless From Start to Storage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eExperience versatile maintenance features, from seamless wall mount storage solutions to the easy empty dust cup. Enjoy hassle-free storage, cleaning, and waste disposal, ensuring your vacuum is always ready for the next use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSee Everything, Clean Everywhere\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSwivel Steering allows X9 Cordless Stick Vacuum to maneuver wherever you need it to go, no matter what obstacles are in the way. The LED headlight illuminates hidden dirt, pet hair, and debris on hard floors and carpets for a thorough clean in every nook and cranny.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eMulti-surface and Multi-level Cleaning\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eInstantly transition from cleaning hard floors to high ceilings, effortlessly captures dust and debris on low-pile carpets, stairs, bare floors, and sealed hard floors, making the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner a truly all-in-one cleaning solution.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUser-friendly Design, Enjoy Secure Storage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSelf-standing Feature: Simply pause your cleaning session and let the vacuum stand upright, without the need to lean it against a wall\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eInnovative Wall Mount: Securely rest your vacuum against the wall for stable, convenient storage, maximizing space and efficiency\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhy Choose the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner 600W 50KPA Perfect for Pet Owners?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Suction:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e Delivers superior cleaning results on all surfaces\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConvenient Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003eSelf-standing feature and wall mount charging for easy storage and access\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e LED touch screen for easy mode selection and real-time adjustments\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAllergen-free Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003eAdvanced filtration system for a healthier home environment\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Runtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eExtended battery life for uninterrupted cleaning\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Attachments: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCleans every corner of your home with ease\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Maintain:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eHands-free dustbin emptying and easy filter maintenance\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUpgrade your cleaning experience with the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner and enjoy a cleaner, healthier, and more efficient home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46373940461823,"sku":"X9","price":189.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_X9_Cordless_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745826968"},{"product_id":"vacuum-bundle-buture-bp20-vacuum-2-batteries-8-hepa-filters","title":"Vacuum Bundle: Buture BP20 Vacuum + 2 Batteries + 8 HEPA Filters","description":"\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eBP20 Vacuum Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1 x BP20 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner\u003c\/strong\u003e (Comes with \u003cstrong\u003e1 battery\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e2 pieces of \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 1 additional battery\u003c\/strong\u003e (Extend your cleaning sessions)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBonus: 6 additional HEPA filters\u003c\/strong\u003e (Maintain top performance with extra dust and allergen protection)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eBP20 Vacuum Bundle Plus\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes everything from the standard bundle, plus:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChoice of: 1 Stainless Steel Filter\u003c\/strong\u003e (Durable and reusable for long-term use), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Floor Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e (Versatile for different surfaces), \u003cstrong\u003eor 1 Dust Cup \u003c\/strong\u003e(Easily removable and washable for longer cleaning sessions) \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"BP20+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters","offer_id":46411371512063,"sku":"BP20KB-1","price":250.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"BP20+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Stainless Steel Filter","offer_id":46411371544831,"sku":"BP20KB-2","price":255.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"BP20+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Dust Cup","offer_id":46411371577599,"sku":"BP20KB-3","price":255.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"BP20+2 Batteries+8 HEPA Filters+1 Floor Brush","offer_id":46411371610367,"sku":"BP20KB-4","price":259.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/BP20Vacuumbundle.jpg?v=1734338120"},{"product_id":"vacuum-bundle-buture-x9-vacuum-2-batteries-8-hepa-filters","title":"Vacuum Bundle: Buture X9 Vacuum + 2 Batteries + 8 HEPA Filters","description":"\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e🎁 \u003c\/span\u003eX9 Vacuum Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1 x X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner\u003c\/strong\u003e (Comes with \u003cstrong\u003e1 battery\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e2 pieces of