6quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;After-you-clean Convenience: The hands-free dustbin gets debris out of your machine in one quick step so you never have to touch the mess. The filters are also easy to clean and replace, ensuring that your vacuum cleaner always performs at its best.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;h4\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gtzllz8iuq9pd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;before\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;after\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;line\u0026quot;:0.8529411764705882}},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;bold\u0026quot;:true,\u0026quot;sz\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;szUnit\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;pt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;One Machine, Multiple Uses\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gu0m6uqcd4umym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Instantly transforms into a powerful cordless handheld vacuum, perfect for cleaning surfaces, soft furnishings, and stairs. Complete with handy tools and quick-release wand, easily clean ceilings, curtains, and upholstery. Deep-clean crevices and tight spaces in your car with the hand vacuum and included attachments.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;h4\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gu0hnxhnhumfcu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;before\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;after\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;line\u0026quot;:0.8529411764705882}},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;bold\u0026quot;:true,\u0026quot;sz\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;szUnit\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;pt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Specialized Tools for Your Convenience\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gu031n2no1noxx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Anti-Mite Brush: Effectively removes dust mites, allergens, and fine particles from mattresses, sofas, and upholstery, promoting a healthier living environment.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gu2nlu2zorbjk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Soft Tube: Provides extended reach and flexibility, making it easier to clean tight spaces, high shelves, and delicate surfaces without causing damage.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gu2bdllp8n374t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Triangular Brush: Designed for precision cleaning, this brush reaches into corners and edges effortlessly, ensuring no dust or debris is left behind.\u0026quot;]]]]\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4jKqmoRaA1eZlw19\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eNew Release! Buture BP20 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner – Your Ultimate Cleaning Solution\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePowered by a high-performance motor and exceptional suction power, the BP20 offers outstanding results across all surfaces. With its self-standing design, smart LED touch screen, and multiple cleaning modes, this vacuum cleaner is the perfect companion for any home. Enjoy the convenience of an integrated wall mount and an assortment of useful accessories for a complete cleaning experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhy Choose the Buture BP20 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e1. Experience Powerful Cordless Cleaning\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCordless Convenience: \u003c\/strong\u003eSeamless transitions between rooms without being tied to an outlet.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnparalleled Power: \u003c\/strong\u003eAdvanced 600W motor delivers exceptional 55kPa suction power, clean up hair, dirt, and dust allergens on hard floors, stairs, carpet and upholstery — all without being plugged in.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e2. Spend Less Time for More Cleaning\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Charging: \u003c\/strong\u003eWall-mounted charging takes only 4-5 hours to fully replenish the battery. When you’re done cleaning, this machine's 4.5 hours charge time ensures it will be ready when you are.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe removable, upgraded 8-cell lithium-ion battery ensures extended runtime for more thorough cleaning sessions, provides up to 60 minutes of continuous cleaning power, covering up to 250 square meters on a single charge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e3. Control Dust Allergen Smartly \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-stage Filtration:\u003c\/strong\u003e fully-sealed filtration system seals in microscopic dust, expelling cleaner air, for a healthier home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced HEPA Filtration: \u003c\/strong\u003ewhole-machine HEPA filtration captures 99.97% of dust allergens for a fresher home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaptures Microscopic Particles: \u003c\/strong\u003eremoves particles as small as allergens, mould spores, dust mites, and pet dander.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e4. Easy to Use \u0026amp; Easy to Maintain\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart LED Display: \u003c\/strong\u003eMonitor battery life, surface type and cleanser level in real time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFingertip Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Controls located on the handle for an easy, seamless clean.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAfter-you-clean Convenience: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe hands-free dustbin gets debris out of your machine in one quick step so you never have to touch the mess. The filters are also easy to clean and replace, ensuring that your vacuum cleaner always performs at its best.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e5. Specialized Tools for Your Convenience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnti-Mite Brush:\u003c\/strong\u003e Effectively removes dust mites, allergens, and fine particles from mattresses, sofas, and upholstery, promoting a healthier living environment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVacuum Hose: \u003c\/strong\u003eProvides extended reach and flexibility, making it easier to clean tight spaces, high shelves, and delicate surfaces without causing damage.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSofa Brush: \u003c\/strong\u003eDesigned for precision cleaning, this brush reaches into corners and edges effortlessly, ensuring no dust or debris is left behind.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e6. One Machine, Multiple Uses\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eInstantly transforms into a powerful cordless handheld vacuum, perfect for cleaning surfaces, soft furnishings, and stairs. Complete with handy tools and quick-release wand, easily clean ceilings, curtains, and upholstery. Deep-clean crevices and tight spaces in your car with the hand vacuum and included attachments.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButure BP20 Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e .bp20-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; table-layout: fixed; } .bp20-table th, .bp20-table td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word; } .bp20-table th { background-color: #EE6819; color: white; font-weight: bold; } .bp20-table tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f9f9f9; } \u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 100%; height: 293.907px;\" class=\"bp20-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Feature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Suction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e600W\/55kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Runtime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eUp to 60 minutes (Max mode: 20 mins)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Self-Standing\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Charging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Item Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e8 pounds\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Dust Cup Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Touch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e Wall Mount\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8066%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48895099437311,"sku":"BP20FXJ","price":109.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_BP20_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1744257758"},{"product_id":"buture-vc10-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-400w-38kpa-copy","title":"Buture VC10 Cordless Vacuum | Official Refurbished","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuTure VC10 400W\/38KPA Powerful Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Touch Screen, 55 Min. Autonomy and Removable Battery, LED Light, 4 in 1 Floor\/Carpet\/Dog Hair Vacuum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【 400W\/38Kpa Powerful Vacuum Ceaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eVC10 Cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with the latest 400W brushless motor with 100,000rpm speed and offers 3 suction modes: MIN-17Kpa, MID-25Kpa and MAX-38Kpa for all types of waste. The MAX 38Kpa suction can easily clean up large particles such as dog food.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Touchscreen \u0026amp; Triple Protection】\u003c\/strong\u003eSweeper vacuum cleaners can set the suction power and check the remaining power through the touchscreen. The blockage detection function and three protection programs protect the motor and battery when the vacuum cleaner is blocked or misused, prolonging its life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【55 Mins Autonomy \u0026amp; Replaceable Battery】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless upright vacuum cleaner uses a 6*2500mAh battery and can work for 20-55 Mins depending on the used vacuum mode. The battery is removable and you can buy additional batteries for longer use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Optimal Filtration】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless vacuum cleaner adopts H13 Medical grade HEPA, which can filter 99.9% of particles as small as 0.3μm and 95% of bacteria and viruses as small as 0.1μm, preventing of allergies in children and pets. The filters are washable and the package contains 3pcs HEPA.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Cordless 4-in-1 Stick Vacuum Cleaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eThe floor brush of the stick vacuum cleaner can swivel 180° left and right and 90° up and down, and the LED light on the head helps you clean the dark corners. Equipped with 4 types of brushes and a telescopic tube to clean carpets, hard floors, furniture surfaces, crevices, and high places.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48933160485119,"sku":"VC10FXJ","price":89.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/products\/VC10.jpg?v=1652079168"}],"url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/collections\/vacuum-cleaner.oembed","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}